{"title":"Bonemeal","sourceTitle":"Bonemeal/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Bonemeal/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Knochenmehl (83% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bonemeal\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Bonemeal (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bonemeal/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Harina de hueso (100% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bonemeal/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Poudre d&#39;os (83% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bonemeal/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Костная мука (83% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bonemeal/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"骨粉 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bonemeal/zh-cn\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"骨粉 (17% translated)\" lang=\"zh-Hans-CN\" dir=\"ltr\">中文（中国大陆）</a></li></ul></div>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Bonemeal</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Bonemeal.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/2c/Bonemeal.png/100px-Bonemeal.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/2c/Bonemeal.png/150px-Bonemeal.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/2c/Bonemeal.png/200px-Bonemeal.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n<b>Bonemeal</b> é obtido moendo <a href=\"/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">ossos</a> em um <a href=\"/Quern\" title=\"Quern\">moinho manual</a> manualmente ou através de <a href=\"/Windmill\" title=\"Windmill\">moinho de vento</a> <a href=\"/Mechanical_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mechanical Power\">mecanização</a>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Uses\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usos\">Usos</span></h2>\n<p>A farinha de ossos pode ser usada como <a href=\"/Farming#Fertilizer\" title=\"Farming\">fertilizante</a> para adicionar nutrientes ao solo em <a href=\"/Farming\" title=\"Farming\">agricultura</a>. A farinha de ossos contém 3% de N (nitrogênio), 30% de P (fósforo) e 0% de K (potássio).\n</p><p>Também pode ser usado para criar <a href=\"/Soil#Crafting\" title=\"Soil\">Terra preta</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115831\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 730/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 30/2097152 b